OL,3,GNEWSADrivers warned of A180 delays due
OL,4,Ato works
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are being warned to expect
OL,7,Fdelays on the A180 in Grimsby as a
OL,8,Flonger contraflow system is introduced
OL,9,Fas part of a major road improvement
OL,10,Fscheme.
OL,12,FThe works, taking place between the
OL,13,FWestgate and Lockhill roundabouts,
OL,14,Finvolves resurfacing the road and
OL,15,Freplacing the central reservation
OL,16,Fbarriers.
OL,18,FNorth East Lincolnshire Council said to
OL,19,Fallow resurfacing work on the eastbound
OL,20,Fcarriageway towards Cleethorpes, the
OL,21,Fexisting contraflow arrangement would
OL,22,Fbe extended.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
