OL,3,GNEWSADrivers warned of A180 delays due
OL,4,Ato works
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a result, the council said the A180
OL,7,Fwould be closed overnight from 20:00
OL,8,FBST on 20 September to enable changes
OL,9,Fto the traffic management system.
